\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces DeGro in the executable-reasoning pipeline. SymCode generates the executable artifact, while DeGro passes a structured \textsc  {ModelSpec} to Z3-backed target-determinacy verification. A determinate target can be answered, an ambiguous target enters grounded repair and validation, and an inconclusive check returns no certificate.}}{3}{figure.caption.6}\protected@file@percent }
